  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When playing VRChat you're missing out on settings that should be implemented, which are basic features of chat programs. These features would be nice due to how these functions would counter client use. These functions are as follows, per player volume control, per player safety settings and not outright blocking the avatar but blocking features off of a model such as animations, and showing avatar author in your menu.\nAnd as additional things to add, being able to limit more things with that config file you guys got on your documentation of VRChat would be awesome. Limit poly, limit mesh particles, limit mesh particle poly, and the like would be useful.",
